; Last Ink master palette (docs/ART_ROADMAP.md 1.3, tools/palette_lock.py).
; Reserved and accent colours first, then 48 shades sampled from the approved Phase 0/1 sprites and meadow tiles.
; One colour per line: #rrggbb then an optional note.
